      "id": "project:iowa-ai-gateway",
      "title": "Iowa AI Gateway",
      "url": "https://airansh.github.io/#/work/iowa-ai-gateway",
      "text": "{\"title\":\"Iowa AI Gateway\",\"subtitle\":\"Enterprise AI, built around real work.\",\"summary\":\"A university pilot bringing multiple AI providers into one HawkID SSO workspace, shaped by faculty, staff, and researcher needs.\",\"category\":\"AI & LLM Systems\",\"context\":\"Professional\",\"organization\":\"University of Iowa ITS\",\"period\":\"2024–present\",\"tech\":[\"LibreChat\",\"OpenAI\",\"Anthropic\",\"Amazon Bedrock\",\"SSO\"],\"contributions\":[\"Led the 147-person pilot and translated use cases into platform configuration.\",\"Delivered agents, artifacts, and custom model parameters in the pilot workspace.\",\"Analyzed pre- and post-pilot feedback to inform the production decision.\"],\"outcomes\":[\"147 pilot participants\",\"Multiple AI providers in one workspace\"],\"study\":{\"problem\":\"Faculty, staff, and researchers needed a way to explore multiple AI models within a university workspace and assess their value for real institutional tasks.\",\"role\":\"I led the pilot, gathered use cases, configured platform capabilities, and analyzed participant feedback as part of the university’s emerging technology work.\",\"requirements\":[\"A HawkID SSO workspace for university participants.\",\"Access to OpenAI, Anthropic, and Amazon Bedrock models.\",\"A structured pilot evaluation to inform production readiness.\"],\"implementation\":[\"Used LibreChat as the multi-model workspace.\",\"Translated participant needs into agents, artifacts, and custom model parameters.\",\"Combined pre- and post-pilot survey analysis with operational feedback.\"],\"validation\":\"I evaluated feedback from 147 faculty, staff, and researchers, comparing pre- and post-pilot surveys to help guide the production decision.\",\"tradeoffs\":\"The pilot brought together participant use cases and survey feedback to assess whether the workspace was ready for broader adoption.\",\"outcome\":\"Provided the pilot findings used to inform the university’s production decision.\"},\"links\":[{\"label\":\"Read pilot announcement\",\"url\":\"https://its.uiowa.edu/news/2026/01/ai-gateway-pilot-what-it-who-its-and-how-join\",\"kind\":\"Pilot announcement\"}]}",
      "references": []
